{"id":"n80936-1-10","stage":4,"title":"칭하다 · 称","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80936-1-10-1","ko":"신인인데 정말 인기가 많으세요.","zh":"您还是新人，人气却这么高啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"신인인데","meaning":"新人，新手","explanation":"신인：新人，新手；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"신인","audio":"/audio/9ba4194ae64dfc992ab2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14071","senseId":"1","lemma":"신인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인기가","meaning":"人气","explanation":"인기：人气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"인기","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70758","senseId":"1","lemma":"인기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많으세요.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9ba4194ae64dfc99","term":"신인","zh":"新人，新手","audio":"/audio/9ba4194ae64dfc992ab2.mp3","entryId":"14071","definition":"在某个领域新登场开始活动的人。","pronunciation":["시닌"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"97bd6aed2c720b21","term":"인기","zh":"人气","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3","entryId":"70758","definition":"许多人对某个对象的浓厚兴趣或喜爱之心。","pronunciation":["인끼"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/d63c37cc19bd614955ab.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n80936-1-10-2","ko":"아니에요. 저는 아직 스스로를 배우라 칭하는 것도 부끄러운데요.","zh":"不，我连称自己为演员都觉得不好意思呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니에요.","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"아니에요","audio":"/audio/2a86f32067c011ee9805.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"스스로를","meaning":"自己","explanation":"스스로：自己；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"스스로","audio":"/audio/53445f4fae94053b5caa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62475","senseId":"1","lemma":"스스로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배우라","meaning":"学，学习","explanation":"배우다：学，学习；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"배우다","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62088","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"칭하는","meaning":"称，称为，口称","explanation":"칭하다：称，称为，口称；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"칭하다","audio":"/audio/e9d7b14b9c7fe6716562.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80936","senseId":"1","lemma":"칭하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것도","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부끄러운데요.","meaning":"害羞，羞涩，腼腆","explanation":"부끄럽다：害羞，羞涩，腼腆；은데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"부끄럽다","audio":"/audio/3109572de7c050e1c422.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60125","senseId":"1","lemma":"부끄럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"53445f4fae94053b","term":"스스로","zh":"自己","audio":"/audio/53445f4fae94053b5caa.mp3","entryId":"62475","definition":"自我本身。","pronunciation":["스스로"]},{"id":"2c65351237177855","term":"배우다","zh":"学，学习","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3","entryId":"62088","definition":"获得新知识。","pronunciation":["배우다"]},{"id":"e9d7b14b9c7fe671","term":"칭하다","zh":"称，称为，口称","audio":"/audio/e9d7b14b9c7fe6716562.mp3","entryId":"80936","definition":"叫或叫做。","pronunciation":["칭하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"3109572de7c050e1","term":"부끄럽다","zh":"害羞，羞涩，腼腆","audio":"/audio/3109572de7c050e1c422.mp3","entryId":"60125","definition":"感到不好意思或难为情。","pronunciation":["부끄럽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1cfb4d47d671faa2ae83.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.129,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=80936","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":149,"sequenceScore":2.9557,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不，我连称自己为演员都觉得不好意思呢。","你是哥哥，怎么还天天和弟弟打架？","您还是新人，人气却这么高啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不，我连称自己为演员都觉得不好意思呢。","您还是新人，人气却这么高啊。","你是哥哥，怎么还天天和弟弟打架？"],"answer":0}]}
